  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIAtr">VII Atr</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et praecipimus, ut in omni congregatione cantetur cotidie communiter pro rege et omni populo suo una missa ad matutinalem missam quae inscripta est 'contra paganos.'</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we decree that in every religious foundation a mass entitled "Against the heathen" shall be sung daily at matins, by the whole community, on behalf of the king and all his people.</ab>
      </div>
